# Trading cycles. Times are container-local — set TZ in .env (default Europe/Sofia),
# where the US session runs 16:30-23:00.
#
# Minutes are deliberately off :00 and :30 to avoid the moment every scheduler on the
# planet fires at once.
#
# Read by supercronic (see Dockerfile). Standard 5-field cron: min hour dom mon dow

12  9  * * 1-5   /app/bin/trade-cycle.sh overnight
 7 13  * * 1-5   /app/bin/trade-cycle.sh premarket
47 16  * * 1-5   /app/bin/trade-cycle.sh open
33 19  * * 1-5   /app/bin/trade-cycle.sh midday
47 22  * * 1-5   /app/bin/trade-cycle.sh close
15 12  * * 6     /app/bin/trade-cycle.sh weekly
15 12  1 * *     /app/bin/trade-cycle.sh monthly
